{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">There is a proportional relationship between <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>. If <math alttext=\"p equals 5,130\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>p</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>5,130</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"t equals 6,840\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>t</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>6,840</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, then what is the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"t equals 5,472\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>t</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>5,472</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["dce3339d-f195-48c3-bcb0-69d3666d64a8"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "8b69eee4-bc07-4a71-bf6f-5c417e689ff1", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"7,296\"><mn>7,296</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "2ee7755f-18bd-45ab-9440-fb79440115e5", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"7,182\"><mn>7,182</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "dce3339d-f195-48c3-bcb0-69d3666d64a8", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"4,104\"><mn>4,104</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "d1840589-303a-4a60-8152-6fb4746ff36b", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"3,762\"><mn>3,762</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. It's given that there is a proportional relationship between <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>. This relationship can be written as <math alttext=\"StartFraction p Over t EndFraction\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mi>p</mi>\n<mi>t</mi>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"p equals 5,130\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5,130</mn></math> when <math alttext=\"t equals 6,840\"><mrow>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>6,840</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> when <math alttext=\"t equals 5,472\"><mrow>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>5,472</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> can be calculated by solving the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 5,130 Over 6,840 EndFraction equals StartFraction p Over 5,472 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>5,130</mn><mn>6,840</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>5,472</mn></mfrac></math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"5,472\"><mn>5,472</mn>\n</math> yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 5,472 right parenthesis StartFraction 5,130 Over 6,840 EndFraction equals StartFraction p Over 5,472 EndFraction left parenthesis 5,472 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mn>5,472</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>5,130</mn><mn>6,840</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>5,472</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mn>5,472</mn></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"p equals 4,104\"><mrow>\n<mi>p</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>4,104</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, when <math alttext=\"t equals 5,472\"><mrow>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>5,472</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"4,104\"><mn>4,104</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "7904b1f4-ccaf-441c-ae58-d8dc651e91cc", "correct_answer": ["C"]}